# TMMT fleet (multi-machine)

## Roles

| Tier | Machines | Job |
|------|----------|-----|
| **Dev** | MacBook(s) | Cursor, feature work, `git push`, Vercel deploy |
| **Hub** | Powerful **Windows** home PC (24/7) | Full AI Brain: Ollama, n8n, Open WebUI, AUTOMATIONS, AIX command system |
| **Workers** | i5 PC, 2× AMD, Surface Pro 4 | Same repo clone, **code sync only** — scripts/agents, not Next dev |

## Canonical paths

- macOS: `~/dev/TMMT` → app `tmmt-os/`
- Windows: `C:\Users\<you>\dev\TMMT` → app `tmmt-os\`

Legacy `Desktop/AIX_Command_Center/TMMT MANAGEMENT` — migrate off.

## Git

- Shared branch: **`main`**
- MacBooks push; hub + workers pull (never competing writes on same branch)

## Scripts (`ops/dev-machine/`)

- `FLEET.md` — full topology
- macOS: `bootstrap-macos.sh`, `sync-machine.sh`, `install-launchd.sh`
- Windows hub: `install-hub-brain-windows.ps1` (full 24/7 brain)
- Windows workers: `set-machine-role.ps1 -Role worker`

## Do not run on every box

- `npm run dev` / full Next build fleet-wide
- Vercel production deploy (MacBook only)
- Duplicate GHL webhook listeners

Production: **Vercel**. Hub runs **optional** local jobs (Python, n8n, cron), not four copies of the web app.
